App environment: "development" uses a local SQLite file (LOCAL_DB_PATH),
"production" uses the Cloudflare D1 HTTP API.
APP_ENV=development

Local SQLite file path (used when APP_ENV=development). `make dev` exports
the production D1 into this file so local queries see the same data.
LOCAL_DB_PATH=.data/dev.sqlite

Cloudflare API token with D1 edit permission (used when APP_ENV=production)
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
CLOUDFLARE_DATABASE_ID=735027ae-2327-4561-8e62-538973817b06

HTTP server port
PORT=8080

Meilisearch (product search)
MEILISEARCH_URL=http://localhost:7700
MEILISEARCH_API_KEY=

Cloudflare R2 (file storage)
R2_ACCOUNT_ID=
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
R2_BUCKET_NAME=
R2_PUBLIC_URL_BASE=

JWT
JWT_SECRET=

WhatsApp Cloud API
WHATSAPP_API_TOKEN=
WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=
WHATSAPP_FROM_NUMBER=
